  "description": "Ashbourne House is a charming colonial guest house built in 1897 and beautifully restored, set in tranquil gardens with mountain views in the heart of Franschhoek village. The guest house offers eight luxuriously appointed air-conditioned rooms and suites, each with its own entrance and private patio or balcony, a heated pool in a lush garden, and a 24-hour self-service barista bar. Guests enjoy imaginative breakfasts, warm hospitality, and an easy stroll to the wine tram, restaurants, and shops.",
